      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Hintergrund im Quallen-Netz bleiben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swarm": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reigen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wechsel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app must be in the foreground to join.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die App muss im Vordergrund sein, um beizutreten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The jellies report no version: firmware from before %@. Modes added since may not exist there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Quallen melden keine Version: Firmware von vor %@. Seither hinzugekommene Modi gibt es dort vielleicht nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The jelly reports no version: firmware from before %@. Modes added since may not exist there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Qualle meldet keine Version: Firmware von vor %@. Seither hinzugekommene Modi gibt es dort vielleicht nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The jelly runs %@, the same as this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Qualle läuft mit %@, genau wie diese App."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name is kept on this phone; the password only if you say so, in the Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Name bleibt auf diesem Telefon; das Passwort nur, wenn du es willst, im Schlüsselbund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original sound-reactive field": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ursprüngliche klangreaktive Feld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The password must be 8 to 63 characters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Passwort muss 8 bis 63 Zeichen lang sein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Telefon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone joins the bloom as a jelly of its own: it gets a colour slot and runs the same effects on the shared clock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Telefon macht im Schwarm als eigene Qualle mit: Es bekommt einen Farb-Slot und zeigt dieselben Effekte im gemeinsamen Takt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone's jelly id": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quallen-Kennung dieses Telefons"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Very dim, cool, hardly moving": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sehr gedämpft, kühl, kaum Bewegung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Virtual jelly": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Virtuelle Qualle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wanders through the calm modes, all jellies together": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wandert durch die ruhigen Modi, alle Quallen gemeinsam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm amber with a hint of candle flicker": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warmes Bernstein mit einem Hauch Kerzenflackern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whisper": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flüstern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone switches Wi-Fi to talk to the bloom. iOS will ask once more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Telefon wechselt das WLAN, um mit dem Schwarm zu sprechen. iOS fragt noch einmal nach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "address unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adresse unbekannt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "app": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "app, no version": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App, keine Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "every %lld s": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "alle %lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS rejected the network name. Try an ASCII name via the firmware's JELL_WIFI_SSID option.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS hat den Netznamen abgelehnt. Versuche einen ASCII-Namen über die Firmware-Option JELL_WIFI_SSID."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows its own dialog before joining. When \"stay\" is off, iOS returns to your usual Wi-Fi about 15 seconds after you leave the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS zeigt vor dem Beitritt seinen eigenen Dialog. Ist \"bleiben\" aus, kehrt iOS etwa 15 Sekunden nach dem Verlassen der App zu deinem üblichen WLAN zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
